#: kbg.cpp:630
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"After you finished your moves, they have to be sent to the engine. You can "
"either do that manually (in which case you should not enable this feature), "
"or you can specify an amount of time that has to pass before the move is "
"committed. If you undo a move during the timeout, the timeout will be reset "
"and restarted once you finish the move. This is very useful if you would "
"like to review the result of your move."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du Dien Töög maakt hest, mööt se dat Speelprogramm tostüert warrn. Dit "
"kannst Du vun Hand maken (denn maak disse Optschoon nich an), oder Du söchst "
"en Töövtiet för't Loosstüern vun den Tog ut. Wenn Du binnen de Töövtiet en "
"Tog torüchnehmen wullt, warrt de Tietgever wedder torüchsett un nieg start, "
"wenn Du den Tog maakt hest. Dat is goot, wenn Du dat Resultaat vun Dien Tog "
"ankieken wullt."

#: kbg.cpp:637
#, kde-format
msgid "Enable timeout"
msgstr "Tietgrenz anmaken"

#: kbg.cpp:642
#, kde-format
msgid "Move timeout in seconds:"
msgstr "Tietgrenz in Sekunnen:"

#: kbg.cpp:656
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Check the box to enable all the messages that you have previously disabled "
"by choosing the \"Do not show this message again\" option."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du all Mellen wedder tolaten wullt, de Du vördem mit de "
"Optschoon \"Disse Mellen nienich wedder wiesen\" utmaakt hest."

#: kbg.cpp:661
#, kde-format
msgid "Reenable all messages"
msgstr "All Mellen wedder tolaten"

#: kbg.cpp:667
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Check the box to automatically save all window positions on program exit. "
"They will be restored at next start."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn Du bi't Beennen all Finsterpositschonen automaatsch "
"sekern wullt. Se warrt bi en nakamen Programmstart wedderherstellt."

#: kbg.cpp:672
#, kde-format
msgid "Save settings on exit"
msgstr "Instellen bi't Beennen sekern"

#: kbg.cpp:740
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You can enable the menubar again with the right mouse button menu of the "
"board."
msgstr ""
"Du kannst den Menübalken wedder aktiveren, wenn Du mit den rechten Muusknoop "
"dat Speelfeld anklickst."

